   数据获取依赖 bilibili 非公开网页接口，可能随时变更、限流或失效。

4. Account Risk / 账号风险：
   Using your own cookies to call these endpoints constitutes automated access
   and MAY violate bilibili's Terms of Service, potentially resulting in
   account restrictions or bans. Use at your own risk, at low frequency, for
   displaying your own data only. The author accepts no liability for any
   consequences.

   使用 Cookie 调用接口属自动化访问，可能违反 bilibili 用户协议并导致账号被
   风控或封禁。请仅低频用于展示自己账号的数据，后果自负。

5. AI-Assisted Development / AI 辅助开发声明：
   This project was developed with substantial assistance from AI coding
   agents, under human direction, code review, and functional testing. The
   source code in this repository is the complete and authoritative description
   of the plugin's behavior; security review by users is encouraged.

   本项目主要由 AI 编程代理辅助完成，人类负责需求、决策、审阅与实测。仓库源码
   即插件全部行为，欢迎安全审计。

6. Privacy / 隐私：
   User credentials (cookie/UID) are stored only in local files on the user's
   own Halo server and are sent only to official bilibili endpoints to fetch
   the user's own stats. This plugin contains no telemetry or third-party
   reporting.

   用户凭据仅存于用户自有 Halo 服务器本地，仅用于向 bilibili 官方接口请求用户
   本人数据；本插件不含任何遥测或第三方上报。

7. Compliance / 合规：
   Users are responsible for complying with applicable laws and bilibili's
   Terms of Service. Scraping or querying other users' accounts is prohibited.

